=== Parameter-passing demo ===

[1] Primitive (int): pass by value
Before: courses = 5
Inside method: courses = 6
After:  courses = 5
-> The method got a copy of the number, so the original did not change.

[2] Object (Student): change a field
Before: Jason Wu, GPA 3.60
Inside method: GPA = 4.00
After:  Jason Wu, GPA 4.00
-> The method got a copy of the reference, but it points to the same object, so the change is visible.

[3] Object (Student): assign a new object
Before: Jason Wu
Inside method: Amy Lee
After:  Jason Wu
-> The method changed only its own copy of the reference. The caller's reference did not change.

[4] String: immutable
Before: program = Software Development
Inside method: program = Software Development (Year 2)
After:  program = Software Development
-> A String cannot be changed. The method made a new String.

